ob filename text source be input ya

exists su name news manuscript replacement lane ob text "" be text ya

exists su name news manuscript stage list template ob text quoted.text.news manuscript scaffold

lane:
[[lane]]

stages:
1. source stage
2. lane stage
3. what happened pool stage
4. what happened sieve stage
5. who decided pool stage
6. who decided sieve stage
7. what changed pool stage
8. what changed sieve stage
9. why it matters pool stage
10. why it matters sieve stage
11. what happens next pool stage
12. what happens next sieve stage
13. numbers and dates pool stage
14. numbers and dates sieve stage
15. news frame stage
