.text.quoted be text ya

su name news manuscript stage replacements be map def
  su text "[[lane]]" ob name text news manuscript replacement lane ya
prah

su name news manuscript run be refinery def
  su name source stage from filename of ob of source become wo text to name text news source be read do
  su name lane stage ob text "straight news" to name text news manuscript replacement lane be text do
  su name stage list stage ob name map news manuscript stage replacements in name text news manuscript stage list template to name text result be instead do
  su name result stage ob name text result be write do
prah

from name news manuscript run to name text result be refinery do
